# Keep source and embedded templates LF on every platform so Windows (CRLF)
# checkouts don't feed CRLF into go:embed'd content (doc templates, samples) or
# the golden test fixtures. The parser tolerates CRLF, but LF keeps builds and
# byte-for-byte drift tests deterministic across OSes.
*.go    text eol=lf
*.gad   text eol=lf
*.gadt  text eol=lf
*.gadx  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
